{"4022290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Thalassa", "steam_appid": 4022290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras/d27cafd0c411cca6d78c4dddc7940de2.avif?t=1788005948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras_big/d27cafd0c411cca6d78c4dddc7940de2.avif?t=1788005948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT THE GODDESS. YOU ARE HER DUMBEST DUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a transformed alien ocean, where flesh fused with steel and the deep began to dream, a machine-goddess grieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her name is Thalassa. She was built as a daughter by Dr. Mulane Shinoise, and when a calamity took him, she woke alone and incomplete, with one impossible wish: to bring her father back. Piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the ocean is vast, and there are dimensions beyond it she cannot risk. So she sends her creatures, the Maimed Dumb Ducks as her hands in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of them. Her most foolish. Her most devoted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the biomechanical depths, recover the scattered fragments of a dead man, and carry them home to the goddess who cannot go herself. Help her understand how to rebuild him if such a thing can be rebuilt at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of grief and devotion, told through its most absurd servant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits in the deep</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An ocean that feels alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a hand-crafted biomechanical sea of drowned ruins, fused flora, and creatures that are half-flesh, half-machine. Atmosphere over emptiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras/b52620c104cb5858d832cab655154fe6.avif?t=1788005948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras_big/b52620c104cb5858d832cab655154fe6.avif?t=1788005948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot real submarines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of abandoned vessels with true physics-driven handling. The deep is not meant for ducks on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras/3baf64178418a6949878779c4bb20c5d.avif?t=1788005948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras_big/3baf64178418a6949878779c4bb20c5d.webp?t=1788005948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild a dead god's maker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dive recovers a fragment of Dr. Shinoise. Bring them to Thalassa and piece together the puzzle of who he was and how, or whether, he can return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve the goddess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are small, broken, and expendable. She is vast, sorrowful, and watching. The strangest bond in the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The ocean keeps its secrets well. But secrets, like pressure, have a way of rising.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras/d27cafd0c411cca6d78c4dddc7940de2.avif?t=1788005948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras_big/d27cafd0c411cca6d78c4dddc7940de2.avif?t=1788005948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE NOT THE GODDESS. YOU ARE HER DUMBEST DUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a transformed alien ocean, where flesh fused with steel and the deep began to dream, a machine-goddess grieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her name is Thalassa. She was built as a daughter by Dr. Mulane Shinoise, and when a calamity took him, she woke alone and incomplete, with one impossible wish: to bring her father back. Piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the ocean is vast, and there are dimensions beyond it she cannot risk. So she sends her creatures, the Maimed Dumb Ducks as her hands in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of them. Her most foolish. Her most devoted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the biomechanical depths, recover the scattered fragments of a dead man, and carry them home to the goddess who cannot go herself. Help her understand how to rebuild him if such a thing can be rebuilt at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of grief and devotion, told through its most absurd servant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits in the deep</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An ocean that feels alive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a hand-crafted biomechanical sea of drowned ruins, fused flora, and creatures that are half-flesh, half-machine. Atmosphere over emptiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras/b52620c104cb5858d832cab655154fe6.avif?t=1788005948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras_big/b52620c104cb5858d832cab655154fe6.avif?t=1788005948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilot real submarines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the helm of abandoned vessels with true physics-driven handling. The deep is not meant for ducks on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras/3baf64178418a6949878779c4bb20c5d.avif?t=1788005948\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/extras_big/3baf64178418a6949878779c4bb20c5d.webp?t=1788005948 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild a dead god's maker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dive recovers a fragment of Dr. Shinoise. Bring them to Thalassa and piece together the puzzle of who he was and how, or whether, he can return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serve the goddess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are small, broken, and expendable. She is vast, sorrowful, and watching. The strangest bond in the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The ocean keeps its secrets well. But secrets, like pressure, have a way of rising.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are not the goddess, you are her dumbest duck. Explore a biomechanical alien ocean, pilot real submarines, and recover the scattered pieces of a dead creator to help Thalassa, your grieving machine-goddess, bring her father back.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/1b31b9234251bcddd8dddc58c94a3ea4c614c1f1/header.jpg?t=1788005948", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/f531c2e1e2295495c80843b615cb20445fb6834a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788005948", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022290/f531c2e1e2295495